 "registration": "CRISM grid co-registered to the CTX basemap by albedo pattern matching (R770 vs CTX, Pearson r=0.67, unique match); the MTRDR label corner was found ~0.68 km west and ~0.11 km north of its image content (2007-era map control). Applied offset: +38 columns, +6 rows at 18 m. Residual registration error estimated < 40 m.",
